  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Second Operation for the Integrated Support for the Social Safety Net Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Segunda operacion para Programa de Apoyo Integral a la Red de Proteccin Social</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Los objetivos especficos de esta segunda operacin son: (i) la consolidacin tcnico-operativa y ampliacin de cobertura del programa de transferencias condicionadas de PRAF, y su articulacin con la RPS; (ii) el diseo e implementacin de un esquema gradual de intervenciones que permita un enfoque integral, la sostenibilidad financiera del Programa, y genera sinergias con la oferta de servicios intersectoriales; y (iii) promover la participacin de los hogares en el mejoramiento de servicios de salud, educacin mediante un esquema de acompaamiento de la oferta a travs de estrategias de intervencin comunitaria.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Specific objetives of second operation: (i) technical and operational consolidation, and the expansion of coverage of the PRAF program, as well as its articulation ot the RPS; (ii) design and implementation of a gradual scheme of interventions to provide for an integral approach, the financial sustainability of the Program and the generation of synergies with intersectorial supply of services and (iii) promote the participation of households in the improvement of health services and education through a supply monitoring scheme of community intervention strategies.</narrative>
  </description>
